OL,3,AMotorhead guitarist Phil Campbell died
OL,4,Afrom multi-organ failure, inquest hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FMotorhead guitarist Phil Campbell died
OL,7,Ffrom multi-organ failure after
OL,8,Fsuffering complications following
OL,9,F"necessary" surgeries, an inquest has
OL,10,Fheard.
OL,12,FThe Welsh rock star, who was the band's
OL,13,Fguitarist from 1984 until it disbanded
OL,14,Fin 2015, died aged 64 on 13 March.
OL,16,FCampbell's death could not have been
OL,17,Fprevented, St Pancras Coroner's Court
OL,18,Fheard on Friday.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,171,160,200,105,0,100
