OL,3,AMotorhead guitarist Phil Campbell died
OL,4,Afrom multi-organ failure, inquest hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe guitarist from Pontypridd, Rhondda
OL,7,FCynon Taf, underwent two liver
OL,8,Ftransplants and bowel surgery at the
OL,9,FRoyal Free Hospital in London earlier
OL,10,Fthis year.
